{"question_id": "kaoyan_math3_1996_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math3_1996", "exam_type": "math3", "year": 1996, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "概率统计", "topics": ["数学期望", "方差", "正态分布", "置信区间"], "methods": ["标准化"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math3_1996_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math3_1996_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/answer_pages/page_004.png"], "stem": "设由来自正态总体$X\\sim N(\\mu ,0.9^2)$容量为9的简单随机样本，得样本均值$\\overline{X}= 5$，\n则未知参数$\\mu$的置信度为0.95的置信区间为 ____．", "answer": "(4.412,5.588)", "explanation": "答案为 (4.412,5.588)。解析见下方答案解析页图；PDF 文本层公式不稳定，未直接转写为 LaTeX。"}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math3_1996_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math3_1996", "exam_type": "math3", "year": 1996, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分"], "methods": ["极坐标变换"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math3_1996_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math3_1996_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/answer_pages/page_004.png"], "stem": "累次积分$\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\d\\theta \\int_0^{\\cos \\theta} f(r\\cos \\theta ,r\\sin \\theta) r\\,\\mathrm{d}r$\n可以写成（ ）\n\nA. $\\int_0^1\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\int_0^{\\sqrt{y - y^2}} f(x,y) \\,\\mathrm{d}x$．\n\nB. $\\int_0^1\\,\\mathrm{d}y\\int_0^{\\sqrt{1 - y^2}} f(x,y) \\,\\mathrm{d}x$．\n\nC. $\\int_0^1\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\int_0^1f(x,y) \\,\\mathrm{d}y$．\n\nD. $\\int_0^1\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\int_0^{\\sqrt{x - x^2}} f(x,y) \\,\\mathrm{d}y$．", "answer": "D", "explanation": "答案为 D。解析见下方答案解析页图；PDF 文本层公式不稳定，未直接转写为 LaTeX。"}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math3_1996_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math3_1996", "exam_type": "math3", "year": 1996, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分", "级数", "敛散性"], "methods": ["极坐标变换", "比较判别法"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math3_1996_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math3_1996_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/answer_pages/page_005.png"], "stem": "下述各选项正确的是（ ）\n\nA. 若$\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}u_n^2$和$\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}v_n^2$都收敛，\n则$\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}(u_n^{} + v_n)^2$收敛．\n\nB. $\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}\\left| u_n^{}v_n \\right|$收敛，\n则$\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}u_n^2$与$\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}v_n^2$都收敛．\n\nC. 若正项级数$\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}u_n^{}$发散，则$u_n^{} \\ge \\frac{1}{n}$．\n\nD. 若级数$\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}u_n^{}$收敛，且$u_n^{} \\ge v_n$（$n = 1,2, \\cdots$），\n则级数$\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}v_n^{}$也收敛．", "answer": "A", "explanation": "答案为 A。解析见下方答案解析页图；PDF 文本层公式不稳定，未直接转写为 LaTeX。"}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math3_1996_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math3_1996", "exam_type": "math3", "year": 1996, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["矩阵", "伴随矩阵"], "methods": [], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math3_1996_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math3_1996_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/answer_pages/page_005.png"], "stem": "设$n$阶矩阵$A$非奇异（$n \\ge 2$），$A^*$是矩阵$A$的伴随矩阵，则（ ）\n\nA. $(A^*)^* = |A|^{n - 1} A$．\n\nB. $(A^*)^* = |A|^{n + 1} A$．\n\nC. $(A^*)^* = |A|^{n - 2} A$．\n\nD. $(A^*)^* = |A|^{n + 2} A$．", "answer": "C", "explanation": "答案为 C。解析见下方答案解析页图；PDF 文本层公式不稳定，未直接转写为 LaTeX。"}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math3_1996_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math3_1996", "exam_type": "math3", "year": 1996, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["向量组线性相关性"], "methods": [], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math3_1996_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math3_1996_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/answer_pages/page_006.png"], "stem": "设有任意两个$n$维向量组$\\alpha_1, \\cdots ,\\alpha_m$和$\\beta_1, \\cdots ,\\beta_m$,\n若存在两组不全为零的数$\\lambda_1, \\cdots ,\\lambda_m$和$k_1, \\cdots ,k_m$，使\n$$(\\lambda_1 + k_1)\\alpha_1 + \\cdots + (\\lambda_m + k_m)\\alpha_m + (\\lambda_1 - k_1)\\beta_1\n+ \\cdots + (\\lambda_m - k_m)\\beta_m = 0,$$\n则（ ）\n\nA. $\\alpha_1, \\cdots ,\\alpha_m$和$\\beta_1, \\cdots ,\\beta_m$都线性相关．\n\nB. $\\alpha_1, \\cdots ,\\alpha_m$和$\\beta_1, \\cdots ,\\beta_m$都线性无关．\n\nC. $\\alpha_1+\\beta_1, \\cdots, \\alpha_m+\\beta_m, \\alpha_1-\\beta_1, \\cdots, \\alpha_m-\\beta_m$线性无关．\n\nD. $\\alpha_1+\\beta_1, \\cdots, \\alpha_m+\\beta_m, \\alpha_1-\\beta_1, \\cdots, \\alpha_m-\\beta_m$线性相关．", "answer": "D", "explanation": "答案为 D。解析见下方答案解析页图；PDF 文本层公式不稳定，未直接转写为 LaTeX。"}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math3_1996_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math3_1996", "exam_type": "math3", "year": 1996, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["概率"], "methods": ["全概率公式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math3_1996_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math3_1996_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/answer_pages/page_006.png"], "stem": "已知$0 < P(B) < 1$且$P[(A_1 + A_2)|B] = P(A_1|B) + P(A_2|B)$，则下列选项成立的是（ ）\n\nA. $P[(A_1 + A_2)|\\overline{B}] = P(A_1|\\overline{B}) + P(A_2|\\overline{B})$．\n\nB. $P(A_1 B + A_2 B) = P(A_1 B) + P(A_2 B)$．\n\nC. $P(A_1 + A_2) = P(A_1|B) + P(A_2|B)$．\n\nD. $P(B) = P(A_1)P(B|A_1) + P(A_2)P(B|A_2)$．", "answer": "B", "explanation": "答案为 B。解析见下方答案解析页图；PDF 文本层公式不稳定，未直接转写为 LaTeX。"}
